Package: fossilagents
Title: Agent-Based Models of Marine Fossil Ecophysiotypes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alison", "Cribb", email = "alison.cribb@earth.ox.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a reusable, framework for modelling local marine 
    fossil ecophysiotype populations through environmental change. Uses
    PBDB data and modeled environmental reconstructions as inputs.
    Initial development focuses on evaluating migration and physiological
    adaptation as explanations for survival across the end-Triassic extinction.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
